          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Solomoni yaalagira okubala abasenze boonaboona abaali mu Isiraeli, ng'oti ni lata we Daudi bwe yakola. Abasenze abo baagheramu emitwalo ikumi n'etaanu n'enkumi isatu na lukaaga (153,600). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku abo, yaatoolaku emitwalo musanvu (70,000) yaabata ku gw'okubbeedanga ebintu eby'okuzimbisa, n'abandi emitwalo munaana (80,000) yaabata ku gw'okubaadhanga amabaale mu biketezo eby'oku nsozi. Ate abandi enkumi isatu na lukaaga (3,600) yaabata ku gw'okulabiriranga abantu abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
